 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "stanza": 0,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 5.5,
   "end": 10.758,
   "text": "Splish, splash goes the water and splash goes the tub,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 0,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 11.178,
   "end": 14.23,
   "text": "it's bubbles and duckies and rub-a-dub-dub."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 0,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 14.65,
   "end": 17.965,
   "text": "And what's peeking up from the bubbles? Oh my!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 0,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 18.385,
   "end": 21.758,
   "text": "Ten little tozies say, \"Hi, Daddy, hi!\""
  },
  {
   "stanza": 1,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 23.578,
   "end": 27.761,
   "text": "Here are the tozies, on the bottom of your feet,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 1,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 28.181,
   "end": 31.85,
   "text": "the heel's on the other side. Kick, splash, how neat!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 1,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 32.27,
   "end": 36.178,
   "text": "The duck says a quack, and the bubbles go pop,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 1,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 36.598,
   "end": 39.999,
   "text": "and ten little tozies say, \"Don't ever stop!\""
  },
  {
   "stanza": 2,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 42.219,
   "end": 46.799,
   "text": "Then out with a whoosh, with a towel warm and wide,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 2,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 47.219,
   "end": 49.759,
   "text": "I dry every tozy, from side to side."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 2,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 50.179,
   "end": 53.913,
   "text": "A rub on your head and a bop on your nose,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 2,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 54.334,
   "end": 58.549,
   "text": "and one extra kiss for those just-washed toes."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 3,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 60.769,
   "end": 65.229,
   "text": "Then on to pyjamas, all stars and moons bright,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 3,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 65.649,
   "end": 68.944,
   "text": "the top goes on easy, the bottoms are tight."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 3,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 69.364,
   "end": 72.777,
   "text": "I wiggle one leg in, and what do you know?"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 3,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 73.197,
   "end": 77.486,
   "text": "Pop! Out of the bottom, five tozies say hello!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 4,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 79.306,
   "end": 82.414,
   "text": "The other leg now, it goes tug, tug, and whee!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 4,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 82.834,
   "end": 85.657,
   "text": "Five more little tozies come waving at me."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 4,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 86.077,
   "end": 89.071,
   "text": "\"Hey, little tozies, get up in those sheets!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 4,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 89.491,
   "end": 92.931,
   "text": "Come sleep right next to me, with your little tozy feet!\""
  },
  {
   "stanza": 5,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 95.151,
   "end": 98.502,
   "text": "So climb up on Daddy, your head's by my knees,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 5,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 98.922,
   "end": 102.455,
   "text": "your tozies by my cheeks, if you please, if you please."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 5,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 102.875,
   "end": 105.935,
   "text": "Here's one little tozy, and here's tozy two."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 5,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 106.355,
   "end": 109.853,
   "text": "Those three in the middle? I don't know them. Do you?"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 6,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 111.673,
   "end": 114.649,
   "text": "Then five on the other, so cuddly and small,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 6,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 115.069,
   "end": 117.972,
   "text": "ten little tozies, and I love them all."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 6,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 118.392,
   "end": 121.162,
   "text": "You giggle and squirm when I tickle your feet,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 6,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 121.582,
   "end": 124.528,
   "text": "you tell me they're stinky, I tell you they're sweet."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 7,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 126.348,
   "end": 130.745,
   "text": "\"Why do I need tozies, when my feet are so big?\""
  },
  {
   "stanza": 7,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 131.165,
   "end": 135.344,
   "text": "So Daddy can kiss them, and tickle, and eat!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 7,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 135.764,
   "end": 138.823,
   "text": "They're the most important part when you walk around,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 7,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 139.243,
   "end": 142.424,
   "text": "they keep you nice and steady, so you don't fall down."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 8,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 144.244,
   "end": 147.476,
   "text": "Those tozies ran out to meet me when I came home through the door,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 8,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 147.896,
   "end": 151.138,
   "text": "they danced in the kitchen and stomped on the floor."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 8,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 151.558,
   "end": 154.285,
   "text": "These tozies look yummy, a tasty treat!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 8,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 154.705,
   "end": 158.134,
   "text": "I'll eat them all up! Nom, nom, nom! Oh, so sweet!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 9,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 160.354,
   "end": 163.304,
   "text": "Now into your bed, and the lamp's turning low,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 9,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 163.724,
   "end": 166.774,
   "text": "I sing you a sweet song, soft and slow."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 9,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 167.194,
   "end": 170.079,
   "text": "I sing to your nose and I sing to your hair,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 9,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 170.499,
   "end": 173.086,
   "text": "and I sing to the tozies still wiggling there."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 10,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 174.906,
   "end": 178.513,
   "text": "Sleep, little tozies, so cuddly and neat,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 10,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 179.313,
   "end": 182.114,
   "text": "the moon's watching over your little tozy feet."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 10,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 182.914,
   "end": 185.706,
   "text": "Snuggle down under, so they won't turn blue,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 10,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 186.506,
   "end": 189.492,
   "text": "all comfy and cosy, the whole night through."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 11,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 192.092,
   "end": 195.47,
   "text": "Your eyes getting heavy, your yawn big and slow,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 11,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 195.89,
   "end": 198.525,
   "text": "I tuck in the blanket from tip to toe."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 11,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 198.945,
   "end": 202.564,
   "text": "I'll keep them all warm and all safe while you sleep,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 11,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 202.984,
   "end": 206.218,
   "text": "ten sleepy tozies, not making a peep."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 12,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 208.038,
   "end": 211.765,
   "text": "From the top of your head to the tip of your nose,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 12,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 212.965,
   "end": 216.839,
   "text": "oh my, little one, Daddy loves those toes."
  }
 ],
 "voice": "clone"
